WEBVTT

00:01.177 --> 00:03.797
[♪ opening theme song playing]

01:31.847 --> 01:33.147
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)]
That weakling

01:33.227 --> 01:35.647
was all bark and no bite.

01:36.517 --> 01:37.567
[spits]

01:38.687 --> 01:39.897
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Now to find

01:39.977 --> 01:41.527
and kill
the rest of these worms.

01:41.607 --> 01:43.277
-Oh, yeah.
-[both laugh]

01:43.357 --> 01:45.617
[LILY] Wait. We're not done.

01:46.317 --> 01:47.327
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Huh?

01:48.037 --> 01:50.577
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)]
Isn't she a persistent one?

01:51.037 --> 01:52.457
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Let's kill her.

01:52.537 --> 01:54.247
♪

01:55.537 --> 01:56.497
[Lily grunts]

01:56.587 --> 01:58.247
I may die...

01:58.337 --> 02:02.757
but I can promise
I won't make it easy for you.

02:03.587 --> 02:05.007
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Actually...

02:05.087 --> 02:06.297
[gasps]

02:06.717 --> 02:07.847
[whimpers]

02:07.927 --> 02:10.307
Death is the easiest option.

02:10.387 --> 02:12.807
Instead,
we condemn you to a long life,

02:12.887 --> 02:15.347
with only your fear
to keep you company.

02:15.437 --> 02:17.017
Terrified of the past,

02:17.097 --> 02:19.477
-unable to move beyond it.
-[grunting]

02:19.567 --> 02:21.067
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)]
You will have no memory

02:21.147 --> 02:22.437
of what occurred.

02:22.527 --> 02:25.607
Only that you were unable
to save your friends.

02:26.607 --> 02:29.947
[Lily screaming]

02:33.787 --> 02:36.457
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
We have nothing to be afraid of.

02:36.997 --> 02:39.037
Even though years have passed,

02:39.127 --> 02:41.957
this girl is the same
as we left her.

02:42.047 --> 02:44.047
You truly expect this fool

02:44.127 --> 02:46.007
to strike
that insignificant mark

02:46.087 --> 02:47.637
you put on our chest?

02:47.717 --> 02:51.307
-Don't be absurd. [laughs]
-[both gasping]

02:51.387 --> 02:54.227
[Radiant Dragon
(Right Head) continues laughing]

02:55.727 --> 02:56.977
[gasps]

02:57.267 --> 02:59.187
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
The most powerful attack

02:59.267 --> 03:01.767
is meaningless
if it doesn't land.

03:01.857 --> 03:05.027
Look, what good
is that boy going to do

03:05.107 --> 03:07.487
-all the way down there?
-[gasping]

03:08.407 --> 03:09.277
[grunting]

03:11.197 --> 03:12.577
[gasping]

03:14.287 --> 03:15.407
[grunting]

03:18.207 --> 03:19.747
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Give up, girl.

03:19.827 --> 03:22.547
You're as powerless as you were
the first time we met.

03:23.457 --> 03:26.587
[LILY] For your information,
my name isn't "girl."

03:26.667 --> 03:29.007
That feeble boy
you're running from is Rein.

03:31.467 --> 03:33.057
And I...

03:33.637 --> 03:35.887
am Lily Flambert.

03:35.977 --> 03:38.267
[screaming]

03:39.187 --> 03:41.267
[LILY] Your scales
are the ultimate armor,

03:41.357 --> 03:44.017
but when you move,
gaps form between them.

03:44.727 --> 03:46.607
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
You little...

03:52.777 --> 03:55.247
[LILY] My blade has pierced
your nerves.

03:55.327 --> 03:57.577
Try making a move
and you'll feel

03:57.657 --> 04:00.077
an excruciating pain
down your spine.

04:00.167 --> 04:02.917
How do you like it?
There's no escape.

04:02.997 --> 04:06.257
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Why you... Damn you, girl.

04:06.337 --> 04:08.127
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)]
Pull yourself together, Right!

04:08.217 --> 04:11.137
They're just a couple of broads!
Hardly a challenge for us!

04:11.217 --> 04:12.677
[screaming]

04:13.297 --> 04:15.427
Do it. Strike the mark, Rein.

04:15.507 --> 04:17.727
If you focus your attack
on a single point,

04:17.807 --> 04:19.267
you can pierce its heart.

04:19.347 --> 04:20.477
[REIN] Got it.

04:20.557 --> 04:24.227
Here I come!

04:26.357 --> 04:27.527
[panting]

04:27.607 --> 04:30.107
Everyone's armor
has reached its limit.

04:30.197 --> 04:33.737
If I can't pull this off,
we're all dead.

04:40.407 --> 04:41.827
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)]
This sword...

04:41.917 --> 04:43.537
is giving me a headache.

04:43.627 --> 04:46.587
Aren't you gonna say something,
Right?

04:46.667 --> 04:49.757
Have you already decided
to throw in the towel?

04:49.837 --> 04:51.337
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
Trust me,

04:51.427 --> 04:54.757
that boy is foolish enough
to try stabbing us in the heart.

04:54.847 --> 04:57.257
We will wait until he is close

04:57.347 --> 04:59.597
and then crush him
in front of that girl

04:59.677 --> 05:01.807
to destroy her spirit.

05:01.887 --> 05:04.807
[gasps] Look out.
They'll use their tail.

05:04.897 --> 05:06.437
Swing your sword
from back there.

05:06.517 --> 05:08.187
You'll still be able to do
plenty of damage

05:08.277 --> 05:09.357
from that distance.

05:12.447 --> 05:14.197
Are you listening, Rein?

05:14.277 --> 05:17.117
[Rein panting]
You don't have to worry.

05:17.197 --> 05:19.867
I'll jump out of the way
of their tail...

05:19.947 --> 05:21.367
before it crushes me.

05:21.457 --> 05:23.167
[LILY] You don't have
the energy for that.

05:23.667 --> 05:24.957
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
This boy...

05:25.037 --> 05:26.707
is nothing but an amateur.

05:26.797 --> 05:29.207
[Rein pants] I'll show you.

05:29.297 --> 05:31.587
I'm gonna stab you
right in your dark heart.

05:31.677 --> 05:34.467
You're not gonna be able to
dodge their tail, you idiot.

05:34.547 --> 05:37.137
Stop trying to show off,
numbnuts!

05:37.217 --> 05:39.217
But if I swing
from all the way back here,

05:39.307 --> 05:40.637
I can't avoid
hitting you ladies.

05:40.717 --> 05:41.847
[both gasp]

05:42.137 --> 05:44.227
[REIN] You won't be able
to withstand the blast!

05:44.847 --> 05:46.107
That fool.

05:46.187 --> 05:48.357
He's always thinking of us.

05:48.437 --> 05:51.357
Rein, stop overthinking
and just swing your sword.

05:51.437 --> 05:52.607
We'll defend ourselves.

05:52.897 --> 05:55.157
[LILY] If you don't,
then we're all gonna die anyway.

05:55.237 --> 05:58.157
[Rein panting]

05:58.237 --> 06:01.117
[Rein groaning]

06:04.207 --> 06:07.167
[crying]

06:07.247 --> 06:08.587
[Lily grunting]

06:08.667 --> 06:10.087
Hurry up!

06:10.167 --> 06:12.297
Swing your sword!

06:12.377 --> 06:14.377
We're giving you an order,
so shut up and follow it,

06:14.467 --> 06:15.677
you earth-tone wearing creep!

06:15.757 --> 06:17.297
Did your grandmother
buy all your clothes?

06:17.387 --> 06:19.007
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
The path to victory is paved

06:19.097 --> 06:20.757
with sacrifices and risks.

06:20.847 --> 06:23.887
This fool
could never understand that.

06:23.977 --> 06:25.437
[Margaret and Lily shout] Rein!

06:26.147 --> 06:27.227
[Rein grunts]

06:28.267 --> 06:29.267
[both scream]

06:30.267 --> 06:32.987
-[both grunt]
-What the hell, man?

06:33.067 --> 06:35.357
I told you
that was gonna happen, you brat!

06:35.447 --> 06:38.237
[Radiant Dragon (Right Head)
laughs]

06:38.317 --> 06:41.407
Your lack of experience
makes you naive!

06:41.487 --> 06:43.997
That is the reason you lost.
[laughs]

06:44.077 --> 06:46.327
I don't think so.
You're the one who lost.

06:46.417 --> 06:47.377
[both gasp]

06:47.457 --> 06:48.917
You drew me in,

06:48.997 --> 06:52.047
getting me as close as possible,
so you could kill me.

06:52.127 --> 06:53.457
But even if I'm an amateur,

06:53.547 --> 06:55.507
I still know all about
long-ranged attacks.

06:55.587 --> 06:57.507
-[both gasp]
-[REIN] From this distance,

06:57.587 --> 07:00.467
I can hit a target
by throwing my sword.

07:00.557 --> 07:01.677
[Radiant Dragon (Right Head)
groaning]

07:04.347 --> 07:06.557
[RADIANT DRAGON (RIGHT HEAD)]
That's impossible.

07:06.637 --> 07:09.687
He's nothing but a boy.
No human, whatever their rank,

07:09.767 --> 07:12.067
should possess this kind
of strength.

07:12.817 --> 07:17.317
What are you?
Some sort of god or demon?

07:17.397 --> 07:18.987
[groaning]

07:19.067 --> 07:20.617
[rumbling]

07:20.697 --> 07:21.947
♪

07:27.917 --> 07:29.247
[Lily grunts]

07:31.417 --> 07:32.627
[LILY] It's dead.

07:34.377 --> 07:36.007
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)] Ow!

07:36.087 --> 07:38.007
Then why am I in pain?

07:38.087 --> 07:39.927
[groaning]

07:40.007 --> 07:41.467
All I ever wanted

07:41.547 --> 07:44.347
was to live a life
full of fun and peace,

07:44.427 --> 07:47.227
but did Right let me?
Of course he didn't.

07:47.307 --> 07:49.937
All because
he was the stronger one.

07:50.017 --> 07:52.937
He constantly threatened me
with shoulder punches,

07:53.017 --> 07:55.187
and he made me do
whatever he said,

07:55.277 --> 07:58.777
like running errands
or making me clean up dogshit,

07:58.857 --> 08:00.777
even though it was his dog.

08:00.867 --> 08:03.657
I've always gotten
the short end of the stick.

08:03.737 --> 08:05.537
I hate this life. It sucks.

08:05.617 --> 08:07.247
Yeah, sounds rough.

08:07.327 --> 08:09.077
-But hey, life sucks.
-[gun clicks]

08:09.157 --> 08:10.167
[BOTH] Huh?

08:10.247 --> 08:11.327
[both gasp]

08:11.417 --> 08:12.667
[LILY] Is that an Uzi?

08:12.747 --> 08:15.047
Why do you have
a freaking submachine gun?

08:15.127 --> 08:16.797
[RADIANT DRAGON (LEFT HEAD)]
Aw, crap!

08:16.877 --> 08:19.087
After I lowered their guard
with my sob story,

08:19.177 --> 08:22.137
I was gonna shoot their asses.
What a blunder.

08:22.757 --> 08:25.007
I never thought
you'd have something like this.

08:25.097 --> 08:27.137
That is quite
the impressive weapon.

08:27.217 --> 08:29.227
Are you seriously going
to mow me down?

08:29.307 --> 08:31.097
Where the heck's
the dignity in that?

08:31.187 --> 08:32.397
Whoa!

08:35.187 --> 08:37.437
You probably don't even know
where the safety is.

08:45.617 --> 08:48.157
[Radiant Dragon (Left Head)
whimpers]

08:48.247 --> 08:52.247
That was close, but I survived.

08:52.327 --> 08:53.707
My heart's busted,

08:53.787 --> 08:55.917
but I think I can manage
somehow.

08:55.997 --> 08:57.337
Should've known this bitch

08:57.417 --> 08:59.257
wouldn't have the guts
to shoot me.

08:59.337 --> 09:02.887
She didn't learn anything.
No wonder her party died.

09:02.967 --> 09:06.137
Imbecile! Idiot!
You're too dumb to live!

09:07.257 --> 09:10.137
[groaning]

09:10.227 --> 09:14.187
[panting]

09:15.307 --> 09:17.817
[MARGARET] You can't let
your guard down around monsters.

09:20.687 --> 09:22.697
Huh, where did Rein go?

09:22.777 --> 09:23.737
[BOTH] Uh?

09:24.777 --> 09:25.907
[LILY] Rein!

09:27.197 --> 09:29.947
Give it to me straight,
how're my left arm and leg?

09:30.457 --> 09:31.747
Still attached?

09:31.827 --> 09:34.287
Yep. Well, for the most part.

09:34.377 --> 09:37.037
The pain. The pain!

09:37.127 --> 09:38.507
[MARGARET]
You sound like the dragon.

09:38.587 --> 09:39.587
[LILY] No kidding.

09:40.917 --> 09:42.007
[Rein sighs]

09:43.717 --> 09:45.797
Thanks.
I feel a whole lot better.

09:45.887 --> 09:48.097
-One million yen.
-Yeah, pay up.

09:49.307 --> 09:50.557
-[LILY] Rein.
-[REIN] Huh?

09:50.637 --> 09:51.767
[MARGARET]
You basically took down

09:51.847 --> 09:53.347
the Radiant Dragon solo.

09:53.437 --> 09:55.437
[LILY] After focusing
your attack on a single point,

09:55.517 --> 09:58.357
you hit the bull's-eye.
The victory's all yours.

09:59.647 --> 10:01.817
Not really. [chuckles]

10:02.987 --> 10:05.407
I couldn't have beaten it
if I was alone.

10:05.487 --> 10:07.577
It's because I had you two.

10:07.657 --> 10:08.947
[both chuckle]

10:09.027 --> 10:11.197
-[REIN] Ow, bad idea!
-[MARGARET] Can you stand?

10:11.287 --> 10:13.957
Careful! He's gonna grope
your bust and butt!

10:14.037 --> 10:15.117
[whimpers]

10:15.207 --> 10:17.537
-[REIN] I've never done that!
-[cries]

10:17.627 --> 10:19.497
Really? Maybe I'm thinking
of someone else.

10:19.587 --> 10:20.667
[REIN] What do you mean,
"maybe"?

10:20.757 --> 10:21.797
[laughter]

10:25.547 --> 10:27.717
-[LILY] Rein, lean on me!
-[REIN] Can I really?

10:27.797 --> 10:29.637
[MARGARET] Watch out.
His hands are drifting.

10:29.717 --> 10:32.927
[laughter]

10:34.057 --> 10:36.767
Hey, I just realized that
I would have been toast

10:36.857 --> 10:38.187
without the armor you gave me.

10:38.267 --> 10:41.567
Likewise. The only reason
I survived that strike

10:41.647 --> 10:43.067
was because
of your enchantments.

10:43.147 --> 10:46.277
Me, too. You saved
both of our lives, Rein.

10:46.357 --> 10:47.527
Same.

10:47.617 --> 10:49.237
If Margaret hadn't given me
that armor,

10:49.327 --> 10:50.617
I would have been toast.

10:50.697 --> 10:52.447
[LILY] Okay, you're just
repeating yourself now.

10:52.537 --> 10:56.287
[all laughing]

10:57.287 --> 10:58.957
[REIN]
Every single person has value,

10:59.037 --> 11:00.627
and obviously that includes you,

11:00.707 --> 11:02.877
so don't be so hard on yourself,
okay?

11:03.717 --> 11:05.717
[grunts]

11:08.597 --> 11:09.797
[grunts]

11:09.887 --> 11:11.347
[gasps]

11:13.177 --> 11:14.347
[gasps]

11:18.097 --> 11:20.147
Why am I shaking?

11:21.517 --> 11:22.767
-[MIRABELLE'S MOM] Mirabelle.
-[gasps]

11:23.107 --> 11:26.107
[MIRABELLE'S MOM] This nice man
hired you to kill someone.

11:26.197 --> 11:27.737
-[MIRABELLE'S BROTHER] Mama!
-[MIRABELLE'S MOM] Hmm?

11:27.817 --> 11:29.567
[MIRABELLE'S BROTHER]
I know I screwed up!

11:29.657 --> 11:31.657
[MIRABELLE'S MOM]
Look at how pathetic he is!

11:31.737 --> 11:34.657
So desperate to be loved!
[laughs]

11:34.747 --> 11:38.037
Yeah! Shed more tears!
That'll change my mind!

11:38.117 --> 11:40.377
Don't think for a second
you're different from them.

11:40.457 --> 11:41.997
You're equally worthless.

11:42.087 --> 11:44.627
Honestly, Mirabelle,
only one word comes to mind

11:44.707 --> 11:48.177
when I think about humanity:
disgusting.

11:48.257 --> 11:50.757
That's why it's okay
to kill people.

11:50.847 --> 11:52.757
Taking down targets
is the only way

11:52.847 --> 11:54.387
to earn Mama's love,

11:54.467 --> 11:57.597
and you want Mama
to love you, don't you?

11:59.347 --> 12:03.687
Mom was right.
I'm worthless, beyond help.

12:04.727 --> 12:06.567
I'm sorry, Rein.

12:06.647 --> 12:08.397
But I have no choice.

12:08.487 --> 12:10.367
I have to murder you.

12:11.527 --> 12:13.737
[REIN] Whoa, the Radiant Dragon
didn't disappoint.

12:13.827 --> 12:15.907
I scored 5,000 points.

12:16.657 --> 12:19.207
[LILY] I did it.
I fought back...

12:19.707 --> 12:21.327
and held my own.

12:21.997 --> 12:23.747
[REIN] Hey, hey, hey, hey!

12:23.837 --> 12:25.667
Check you out,
striking a cool pose

12:25.757 --> 12:26.917
like you're back
in middle school.

12:27.007 --> 12:28.257
Bet you broke that out
all the time

12:28.337 --> 12:29.927
for those summer snapshots, huh?

12:30.007 --> 12:31.337
Summer talk gets me fired up!

12:31.427 --> 12:32.887
Global warming
ceaselessly advances!

12:32.967 --> 12:34.927
Is there a name
for what's wrong with you?

12:35.007 --> 12:37.057
[REIN] Come on, I wanna see
that cool pose again!

12:37.137 --> 12:38.477
[LILY] You're so annoying.

12:43.147 --> 12:44.107
[gasps]

12:44.187 --> 12:45.187
[MARGARET] I know we had a deal,

12:45.607 --> 12:47.817
but I'm not going
to let you hurt them, Mirabelle.

12:48.437 --> 12:49.697
Not only are you slower

12:49.777 --> 12:51.237
compared to our
earlier encounter,

12:51.317 --> 12:52.567
but your ability
to conceal yourself

12:52.657 --> 12:54.197
-is starting to suck.
-Mirabelle.

12:55.367 --> 12:57.617
All of you, stay away from me.

12:59.457 --> 13:00.707
♪

13:03.497 --> 13:04.707
[MIRABELLE] Rein...

13:05.417 --> 13:08.797
when you were nice to me
and said I wasn't worthless,

13:09.547 --> 13:12.337
deep inside,
I felt kind of happy.

13:13.847 --> 13:17.927
It got me thinking
about how others have value,

13:18.017 --> 13:20.227
and it wouldn't be so bad
cherishing them.

13:22.017 --> 13:25.477
What I'm feeling,
it's completely new.

13:26.397 --> 13:27.517
Until this point,

13:27.897 --> 13:31.397
I saw no difference between
humans, bugs, and beasts.

13:31.487 --> 13:34.317
In my eyes,
they were just lumps of flesh.

13:34.407 --> 13:38.747
But now I see.
I can't kill anyone anymore.

13:39.447 --> 13:44.287
At this rate, because of you,
because of you...

13:44.877 --> 13:47.207
Mama will abandon me.

13:47.287 --> 13:48.877
[both gasp softly]

13:48.957 --> 13:50.717
-I'm sorry.
-Don't apologize.

13:51.297 --> 13:52.837
[MIRABELLE] Mama.

13:52.917 --> 13:56.137
Listen, I'll help you think
through this if you want.

13:56.217 --> 13:57.847
I'm doubtful
you'd be able to walk

13:57.927 --> 13:59.427
and hold a thought
at the same time.

13:59.507 --> 14:02.097
Why don't you come with us,
Mirabelle?

14:02.177 --> 14:03.597
[footsteps]

14:03.687 --> 14:06.107
[LILY] Did you forget
the whole reason we came here?

14:09.147 --> 14:10.107
[ALL] Uh?

14:10.187 --> 14:11.237
[REIN] It's Poophead!

14:11.317 --> 14:13.147
Screw every last one of you,
twerps!

14:13.237 --> 14:14.737
Dig me out of this rubble!

14:14.817 --> 14:17.987
-[MARGARET] Sexy, sexy...
-[CORNELIUS] You!

14:18.077 --> 14:20.237
-Sexy, sexy...
-Yeah, help me, Mirabelle.

14:20.327 --> 14:22.867
Come on, you little brat,
hurry up and kill them.

14:22.957 --> 14:23.997
[MARGARET] Sexy, sexy...

14:24.077 --> 14:26.827
I... I've already earned my pay.

14:26.917 --> 14:28.497
If I hadn't
fought the Radiant Dragon,

14:28.587 --> 14:29.667
we'd all be dead right now.

14:29.747 --> 14:31.667
Apples and oranges, kill them!

14:31.757 --> 14:33.167
They're literally right there.

14:33.257 --> 14:35.547
Or maybe you wanna
make your mom disappointed

14:35.637 --> 14:38.427
and never ever love you.
Let me take a wild guess.

14:38.507 --> 14:40.597
Rein here told you
people aren't worthless.

14:40.677 --> 14:43.057
What a joke.
You're too smart for that lie.

14:43.137 --> 14:44.137
[MIRABELLE] A lie?

14:44.227 --> 14:45.767
There's no shame
in being deceived,

14:45.847 --> 14:48.397
but, obviously, it was a lie
since it was the only way

14:48.477 --> 14:50.897
he was gonna
avoid getting shanked by you.

14:50.977 --> 14:53.567
What he told me
didn't sound like a lie.

14:53.647 --> 14:55.147
[CORNELIUS]
So, you're best friends now?

14:55.237 --> 14:57.277
Rein's going to be
your weekend bowling buddy?

14:57.367 --> 14:59.027
He was using you.

14:59.777 --> 15:01.197
Would you get with the program?

15:01.277 --> 15:03.037
Haven't you killed
dozens of people?

15:03.117 --> 15:05.037
Lame-o normies
typically don't associate

15:05.117 --> 15:06.407
with psychos like you.

15:06.497 --> 15:08.537
They're under
the impression you're insane.

15:08.627 --> 15:10.997
But who's the only one
who would ever love a worthless,

15:11.087 --> 15:12.877
evil murderer like yourself?

15:12.957 --> 15:14.417
Your mom.

15:14.507 --> 15:15.587
And the only way

15:15.667 --> 15:18.587
to keep her loving you
is by killing.

15:18.677 --> 15:20.757
[grunts]
Stop poisoning her mind.

15:20.847 --> 15:23.677
Mirabelle is trying to change
despite the hand she was dealt.

15:23.767 --> 15:24.887
What's with you
constantly trying

15:24.977 --> 15:25.977
to tear her down?

15:26.307 --> 15:28.057
[CORNELIUS] Why am I
the only one cracking up

15:28.147 --> 15:29.727
over the cheesy shit
he just said?

15:29.807 --> 15:31.687
It's like I'm relaxing
in a warm living room

15:31.767 --> 15:33.647
and watching TV with my pet dog!

15:33.727 --> 15:35.397
-[laughs]
-[Rein grunts]

15:35.487 --> 15:36.987
I wasn't telling lies.

15:37.067 --> 15:39.027
You're the one
making up junk to trick her.

15:39.117 --> 15:40.947
[screams] Ow!

15:41.027 --> 15:43.447
[CORNELIUS] Trust me, Mirabelle!
I've seen the world!

15:43.537 --> 15:45.787
People are worthless!
Your mom is all you have!

15:45.867 --> 15:47.827
Killing people is awesome!
Hooray for murder!

15:47.907 --> 15:49.457
[REIN] He's lying, Mirabelle.

15:49.537 --> 15:51.627
It's the people who say
everyone's worthless

15:51.707 --> 15:53.127
you can't trust.

15:53.207 --> 15:56.167
[grunts] I don't know
what to believe.

15:56.257 --> 15:58.717
Are you so stupid
I have to break it down more?

15:58.797 --> 16:01.217
First off,
you're a mass murderer!

16:01.297 --> 16:02.797
The scum of the earth!

16:02.887 --> 16:04.097
-Picture this!
-[Rein grunts]

16:04.427 --> 16:06.097
There's a defenseless stranger
on the side of the road.

16:06.177 --> 16:08.187
[shouts] Don't listen to this
pale-eyed poop bag!

16:08.267 --> 16:09.597
People have value!

16:09.687 --> 16:12.057
-They do! They do!
-The lungs on this kid!

16:12.147 --> 16:13.567
Stop shouting, you freak!

16:13.647 --> 16:16.817
[REIN] They have value!
Yes, they do, do, do, do...

16:18.317 --> 16:21.947
-[Rein screaming]
-Mirabelle, roughly translating,

16:22.027 --> 16:24.117
Rein is trying to say
that people aren't worthless.

16:24.197 --> 16:26.327
[Rein and Lily screaming]

16:26.407 --> 16:28.707
[MARGARET] Look at how hard
he's willing to fight for you.

16:29.827 --> 16:31.747
Surely this freak out
makes you realize

16:31.827 --> 16:34.497
you don't have to take lives
to be worthy of a good one.

16:34.587 --> 16:36.877
[Rein continues screaming]

16:36.957 --> 16:38.167
[MIRABELLE] Mm...

16:39.627 --> 16:41.587
Around the first time
I met Rein,

16:41.677 --> 16:44.177
he said something similar to me
that I needed to hear.

16:44.257 --> 16:45.557
Now I see how much it helped.

16:45.637 --> 16:48.267
-[MARGARET] Stop!
-Jeez! You don't have to yell!

16:48.347 --> 16:50.387
[Lily groans, gasps]

16:54.357 --> 16:55.687
[LILY] Goblins!

16:56.397 --> 16:58.317
Hey, so Lily, you don't think

16:58.397 --> 17:00.107
all my big shouting
gave us away, right?

17:00.197 --> 17:02.157
Whispering now isn't gonna
fix anything.

17:02.237 --> 17:03.487
[CORNELIUS]
Don't just stand there!

17:03.567 --> 17:05.197
How is this even fair?

17:05.277 --> 17:07.287
You're gonna let me die
under an ancient column?

17:07.367 --> 17:09.037
All that talk about changing,

17:09.117 --> 17:10.907
but when you have the chance
to save my life,

17:10.997 --> 17:12.537
you're gonna murder me
by doing nothing!

17:12.627 --> 17:14.917
-You're worthless after all...
-You ask me, we should run.

17:14.997 --> 17:17.127
This guy's earned
whatever's coming to him.

17:17.207 --> 17:18.547
I'm willing to bet
he's thinking,

17:18.627 --> 17:20.257
"Fine, I'll at least leave
a mark on you

17:20.337 --> 17:22.887
before I die, damn it.
Goodbye forever."

17:23.507 --> 17:24.507
[all gasp]

17:25.347 --> 17:28.057
-[gasps] She's fast.
-What are you doing, Mirabelle?

17:28.137 --> 17:30.927
[MIRABELLE] Cornelius,
I'm gonna tell my mom.

17:31.017 --> 17:31.977
[CORNELIUS] Huh?

17:32.387 --> 17:34.437
[MIRABELLE] I'm gonna tell her
I'm not worthless,

17:34.517 --> 17:36.437
that I don't kill people
anymore.

17:36.517 --> 17:37.527
[all gasp]

17:37.607 --> 17:38.977
[MIRABELLE]
If that changes things

17:39.067 --> 17:42.237
and she abandons me,
then I'll just have to move on.

17:43.107 --> 17:45.277
I'll find people
who actually value me,

17:45.367 --> 17:48.197
allies who offer support
and work hard for each other.

17:48.287 --> 17:49.697
A real family.

17:49.787 --> 17:51.537
[goblins yelling]

17:51.617 --> 17:53.327
-Mirabelle!
-Get out of there!

17:53.417 --> 17:54.417
[goblins yelling]

17:54.497 --> 17:55.997
[MIRABELLE]
From this day forward,

17:56.087 --> 17:59.207
I won't kill people.
I'll only use my power for good.

17:59.297 --> 18:00.207
[screaming]

18:02.877 --> 18:04.587
I'll use it to save lives.

18:04.677 --> 18:06.347
[goblins yelling]

18:06.427 --> 18:10.017
[Mirabelle yelling]

18:14.347 --> 18:15.647
[all gasp]

18:16.107 --> 18:17.687
No way!

18:18.647 --> 18:20.687
She took them all out.

18:21.477 --> 18:22.607
[Cornelius breathes shakily]

18:22.687 --> 18:24.857
[MIRABELLE]
Don't be afraid, Cornelius.

18:25.907 --> 18:27.697
I'm stronger than I look.

18:31.077 --> 18:33.367
[MIRABELLE] He promises
to never hurt you again.

18:33.867 --> 18:35.417
I'll make sure of it.

18:35.497 --> 18:37.837
-[REIN] Hm.
-And we're grateful.

18:38.957 --> 18:40.667
-[REIN] Mirabelle.
-Uh?

18:40.747 --> 18:42.707
What do you think
Lefaid is like?

18:43.377 --> 18:45.467
I don't know.

18:45.547 --> 18:47.637
-[REIN] Wanna see?
-[gasps]

18:48.047 --> 18:49.967
Mm. I do!

18:50.057 --> 18:52.467
Oh, good!
'Cause I'm not showing you.

18:52.557 --> 18:54.977
-Go home with Cornelius first.
-Huh?

18:55.057 --> 18:57.437
-But why, though?
-Shut up.

18:57.517 --> 18:59.817
I realize it's gonna
take a whole lot of courage

18:59.897 --> 19:02.437
to tell your mom how you feel,
but I know you can do it.

19:02.527 --> 19:05.197
So stand up for yourself
and show you have worth.

19:05.527 --> 19:07.817
After you confront her,
come and find us.

19:07.907 --> 19:09.697
I'll show you the sword then.

19:10.327 --> 19:12.077
[exclaims]

19:12.157 --> 19:13.237
Mm.

19:13.577 --> 19:16.867
I promise you, I'll come back,
so have it ready.

19:16.957 --> 19:20.087
Yep, I promise, too.
Best of luck.

19:20.537 --> 19:22.747
[Mirabelle chuckles]

19:23.297 --> 19:24.207
[footsteps receding]

19:25.547 --> 19:28.047
Even Rein
can be sensible sometimes?

19:28.137 --> 19:29.177
Guess so.

19:29.257 --> 19:30.757
What do you mean?

19:30.847 --> 19:32.427
I'm like the pinnacle
of sensible.

19:32.517 --> 19:33.927
[gasps] He said that!

19:34.017 --> 19:35.307
And he did it
with a straight face!

19:35.387 --> 19:37.187
Yeah, maybe he's pissed off.

19:37.267 --> 19:38.727
I'm slowly discovering

19:38.807 --> 19:41.017
I always get things done
whenever it counts the most.

19:41.107 --> 19:43.227
Like when you attracted
those goblins by shouting?

19:43.317 --> 19:44.397
You've acted like an idiot

19:44.477 --> 19:46.737
on plenty of
inappropriate occasions.

19:49.067 --> 19:50.317
Uh, freaky.

19:50.407 --> 19:52.737
Yeah, please never smile again.

19:56.197 --> 19:57.577
[Rein exclaiming]

19:57.657 --> 20:01.537
Now this is a place worthy
of hiding a legendary sword.

20:01.627 --> 20:03.247
The excitement and anticipation

20:03.337 --> 20:05.627
are making it hard
to breathe. [giggles]

20:05.707 --> 20:07.257
[LILY] You sure
that's not asthma?

20:10.177 --> 20:11.047
[all gasp]

20:11.797 --> 20:13.137
[LILY] This is definitely it.

20:15.767 --> 20:17.017
Lefaid.

20:19.597 --> 20:21.937
It's all yours. Go get it, Rein.

20:22.477 --> 20:23.517
Right.

20:40.577 --> 20:42.037
This is it.

20:43.337 --> 20:44.497
Lefaid.

20:49.167 --> 20:50.677
[footsteps]

20:50.757 --> 20:52.797
[REIN] So, honest opinion,

20:52.887 --> 20:55.057
how much do you think
I grew on this quest?

20:55.137 --> 20:56.097
[chuckles]

20:57.017 --> 20:59.807
-[Lily chuckles nervously]
-[Margaret exclaims]

21:00.597 --> 21:02.307
[LILY] Let's put it this way.

21:02.397 --> 21:03.977
If you take a look outside,

21:04.057 --> 21:06.317
the world might look
a little different now.

21:06.397 --> 21:08.067
Yeah, great answer.

21:08.147 --> 21:10.567
It'll feel
entirely new out there.

21:10.647 --> 21:12.777
If you're both saying that,
it must be true.

21:12.867 --> 21:14.067
[BOTH] Sure.

21:14.157 --> 21:16.077
♪

21:27.917 --> 21:29.917
Ugh, so bright!

21:30.007 --> 21:32.547
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:03.517 --> 23:04.727
[MARGARET]
Good morning, everyone.

23:04.807 --> 23:05.767
[BOTH] Hmm?

23:06.057 --> 23:08.107
Lovely weather we're having,
huh?

23:10.187 --> 23:11.187
[BOTH] Huh?

23:12.687 --> 23:15.857
Uh? Right. Hold on.

23:20.487 --> 23:21.787
[both exclaim]

23:26.957 --> 23:29.497
-[exclaims]
-Big fan of peek-a-boo, Rein?

23:29.587 --> 23:33.917
[all laughing]
